      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Questions from patients about pain conditions and analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. This article provides information to patients regarding the treatment of neuropathic pain syndrome. It narrates how a doctor might explain neuropathic pain to a patient and particularly discusses the use of anticonvulsants."},
